    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by subsection (1) of Section 71 of the Ocean University of Sri Lanka Act, No. 31 of2014, I, Piyasena Gamage, Minister of Skills Development and Vocational Training do by this Order declare that theNational Institute of Fisheries and Nautical Engineering Act, No. 36 of 1999 shall stand repealed with effect from the 17thday of June 2015.PIYASENA GAMAGE,Minister of Skills Development and Vocational Training.",
